<title>JAPAN: Ozaki Fine to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Ozaki Fine to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ozaki Fine Chemical Corp said on Friday that it would buy back up to 300,000 of its shares, or up to 240 million yen worth.</p>
</text>
